ta and statistics to track the evolution of the electorate and your campaign<br></li><li>And much more to discover!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384880/extras/89f5f9da71936fbae0ffd9b50678b649.poster.avif?t=1747037115\" width=618 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384880/extras/89f5f9da71936fbae0ffd9b50678b649.webm?t=1747037115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384880/extras/89f5f9da71936fbae0ffd9b50678b649.mp4?t=1747037115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
